{"id":47231,"date":"2025-12-13T08:07:23","date_gmt":"2025-12-13T07:07:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47231"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:43:25","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:43:25","slug":"meia-maratona-baia-do-seixal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-baia-do-seixal\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona Ba\u00eda do Seixal 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>21 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, na emblem\u00e1tica frente ribeirinha da cidade do <strong>Seixal<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. Organizada pela prestigiada <strong>We Run<\/strong> com o forte apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio do Seixal<\/strong>, a prova \u00e9 uma das meias maratonas mais velozes, c\u00e9nicas e concorridas da \u00c1rea Metropolitana de Lisboa e Margem Sul do Tejo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada instaladas junto \u00e0 Ba\u00eda do Seixal, o tiro de partida para a <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> e para a <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> soa \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, seguindo-se a <strong>Caminhada (5 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h35<\/strong>. O circuito totalmente plano abra\u00e7a as \u00e1guas tranquilas da ba\u00eda natural com vista panor\u00e2mica para Lisboa, oferecendo abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal com chip e medalha de finalista de alto relevo.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style