orrida de 10 km<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O percurso \u00e9 prop\u00edcio a recordes pessoais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, \u00e9 um tra\u00e7ado totalmente plano, com piso em asfalto de excelente qualidade e protegido do vento na maior parte da ba\u00eda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos e medalha finisher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s do portal oficial <a href=\"https:\/\/werun.pt\/eventos\/meia-maratona-baia-do-seixal-2027\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"no